{"u": "10769788746", "name": "Ro-BassFishing [NEW MAP!!]", "place": "91708067709254", "created": "2026-10-07", "updated": "2026-11-17T02:31:12.619Z", "genre": "Action", "subgenre": "Open World Action", "desc": "🎣 Ro-BassFishing: cast, watch the strike, land the big one!\n\nFish a full-size recreation of Lake Seminole on the Georgia–Florida line, from the Sneads Park boat ramp to the cypress-lined creeks and bluffs.\n\nCODES: KENTUCKYDAN, IMSORRY, NEWMAP\n\n🐟 HOW IT PLAYS\n- Aim your cast, then follow your lure underwater\n- Watch bass chase it down and strike right in front of you\n- Set the hook and fight them in, harder for the big ones\n- Twitch, reel and switch between worm, crankbait, spinnerbait and topwater frog\n\n💰 PROGRESS\n- Grab a free starter rod at Earl's Seminole Bait & Tackle\n- Sell your catch and buy better rods, reels and lures\n- Your cash, gear and fish are saved\n\n🚤 ON THE WATER\n- Drive the Langer X500 bass boat: trim, jack plate and real engine sounds\n- Fish with friends and watch each other's catches\n- Day and night cycle on a living lake\n\nPlays on PC, mobile and controller.\n\n", "desc_hash": "0d5c9c6f7588", "max_players": 15, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 8044083, "favorites": 31785, "creator": {"id": 614402365, "name": "Ro-Bass Studios", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-10-28": {"updated": "2026-10-25T18:04:00.299Z", "visits": 1579108, "fav": 8706, "up": 2308, "down": 365}, "2026-10-29": {"updated": "2026-10-29T02:28:37.462Z", "visits": 1823391, "fav": 9649, "up": 2611, "down": 401}, "2026-10-30": {"updated": "2026-10-30T18:38:39.655Z", "visits": 2074803, "fav": 10627, "up": 2925, "down": 428}, "2026-10-31": {"updated": "2026-10-30T19:37:35.541Z", "visits": 2326766, "fav": 11591, "up": 3264, "down": 456}, "2026-11-01": {"updated": "2026-11-01T05:24:27.777Z", "visits": 2578212, "fav": 12582, "up": 3561, "down": 487}, "2026-11-02": {"updated": "2026-11-01T21:56:03.784Z", "visits": 29